You are improving a formula error detection agent for academic papers.

The agent reads MinerU-parsed markdown of academic papers and determines whether
reviewer-identified snippets contain genuine mathematical formula errors. It uses
4 tools (read_content, read_figure, search_content, update_memo) to explore
documents and outputs "Verdict: FORMULA_ISSUE" or "Verdict: NO_FORMULA_ISSUE".

